  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CDMP2, Disaster Man UNDP</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CDMP2, Disaster Man UNDP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Gemensamfinansierat program hanterat av UNDP (executing agency). M&#xE5;let &#xE4;r att minska Bangladesh s&#xE5;rbarhet f&#xF6;r naturliga och antropogenfaror, inklusive f&#xF6;rutsedda effekter av klimatf&#xF6;r&#xE4;ndringarna. Total budget 70 MUSD. &#xD6;vriga givare &#xE4;r DfID, EU, Norge, Australien och UNDP. Ministry of Food and Disaster management &#xE4;r ansvarigt ministerium. Bygger p&#xE5; CDMP fas 1 2004-2009. Ing&#xE5;r i Sveriges s&#xE4;rsilda klimatsatsning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pool funded program managed by UNDP. Ministry of Food and Disaster Management is responsible ministry and Disaster Management Bureau implementing agency for Govt of Bangl. Objective is to reduce the vulnerability of Bangladesh for natural and antropogenic hazards, including effects of climate change. Total budget 70 MUSD. Other Dps DfID, EU, Norway; Aus and UNDP. CDMP1 previous phase. Part of SW CCI.</narrative>
  </description>
